  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ea0808c4821b9744b95a3b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么好呢？\r\n让我听听姐姐的想法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "234a8a7a4fc400e504ea9e1c59c7de9a2fd4b4b4d171230d9a60a54886e0bc8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7811ece3a2f7b4680044cf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐要说什么我全都知道。\r\n但机伶也是赛马娘，\r\n总会有办不到的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a2c217a75ede700540f6ffcc95da0b0098679999c1d3390115dbe854446d4d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea856c274a92f04d8e8c3f9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦～又要比赛？\r\n噗，姐姐真坏心眼。\r\n……之后要给我奖励哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a45bd101236a09fd2c74460ebd0b726195e0e983abb9de7a3d5037f0742e6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf1797f1854045c88ab77a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……姐姐，机伶的身心状况\r\n确实都管理得滴水不漏。\r\n可是……你做得太过火了！啪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "190acdf85eb329fea88b5fc1cb3a67ce0d3ff0157dcb4a9bf1cada003b78609e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab2efa1646c59d018cb9b99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯，心情好极了！\r\n接着只差姐姐一句「可爱」，\r\n准备的部分就完美无缺了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fdbc2e4e34bc4da68447b9f52658b03bca877af1f46209f7af39e55a51815d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3ae3660cefece3dfd452f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，听我说听我说！\r\n机伶……状况可能挺不错的♪\r\n你可以有所期待哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd599244426fafbb7d3ea1cdfb93f7824c9df56c05ee0f6dee757cda86a3170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73776dfda9241a45fe61eeee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……不要紧，机伶办得到。\r\n不管是姐姐或大家……\r\n应该都是这么相信的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8958137b706d3b65794e9d1c3a469e5521dfd562616877a05db287e34570aff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1751ed5f8f0c8f6847188a5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你哦，姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "572b8df1287dabd794b751a65ad7008c9492234d1e2adff1b9cc6a9bc6ecbfc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20149"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50e41664158b728aeaa99750",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你很努力了，姐姐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e516d94850269e16174cbb380ef22ebe508482b92e1004bc37e3021bd9496c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "20150"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da2d5ea1088b7bad6910aebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们走吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "87acf7dceacc0060a2d9da85debd02a2d7310f7a0402644ad624c55b6ef33803",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8740d8d2978666abd649e1e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要可爱地加油哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "16924de4c6f6715adf09d66bfff62fd0d65f415d4cbb4580dd54682aafc0ba26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507117921121c6c2cdb72993",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你哦，哥哥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c69057567c363a194325466d557d5388101a87045276bc82da0cc8733dff9f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a243e2154c3c95c7de07889",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得……自己应该赢得了，\r\n实际上输掉就不可爱了嘛。\r\n好啦好啦，我们来讨论策略吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c90e5f20463f337e0db8b9832fca674bf44dade77a5a30a55b3b816569756bbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48535f4fbe4e08cb15af1f5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "计划与模拟都万无一失，\r\n接着只要真机伶去跑就好……呵呵♪\r\n除了获胜之外，想不到其他结果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b1629e076d66f5e66e30f0f62ab409eb791b1fb0f800c7f333d2b6a67d5cb4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e087eb9fa0a4d954338af8f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你哦，哥哥。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c69057567c363a194325466d557d5388101a87045276bc82da0cc8733dff9f76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3842fb5a30d947477b90e18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你哦，姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "572b8df1287dabd794b751a65ad7008c9492234d1e2adff1b9cc6a9bc6ecbfc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5825c0562044b0a98e0311d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你哦，姐姐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "572b8df1287dabd794b751a65ad7008c9492234d1e2adff1b9cc6a9bc6ecbfc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "2037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c8b0c8dfb4a80cf4255d1d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はじめよっか♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "76bf5fd8e2806fef4178f292b7536fd564738f75cd2017dafb687ce1432ba830",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a43e1a98a0870a3e4ae45f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜，不过做得很好♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb79d77808b1166b1048bc7da1b1ec870c0853b1da03ecdbeb9651771b078edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737c845768eedcde46a77ccb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勉强过关吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "260d7f2cc093cad29899622ea8a13ae386440860ad5da28d7a03cdd2a0737d58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9db5593cb1ec6093d4bc3dcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……下次再加油吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "15291001a0d52a8b43ac767f309446149a1764d849705eed632f55b257c305a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1308f0573c4542ee2750fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……一点都不可爱～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b6d83ee87ad863d8232f84f3769f1adbab6632aaae1d0dd7cf7b6e15125d19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f6b039272d09a94e5cd560",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的机伶也最～可爱了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "73940252d1ebab6c25787dfb84e616d7134eaa1fd0019e110333e8cb0024d334",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4f09aa96df9df85363e3a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了～♪是机伶赢咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d6f8cc97940ab3396af50c3005f481ac4ddaaafd8070bd62139237904e786d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bca60b3de93423ea54c647fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪机伶在此发誓，\r\n会永远保持可爱～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c44e7419427da284c528b3d032583b3a7d7262d0211b7956033bf020bca88ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9454368745ef04757b8b682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了～♪是机伶赢咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d6f8cc97940ab3396af50c3005f481ac4ddaaafd8070bd62139237904e786d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1b3df13959c728ff2afc83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仔细看好我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c7e2e21ab14a34f0dd4f20ed789985144e8fa63b1742a6e32a97cf736cd6faa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d66f1d6203e6b6e37bd69fbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把可爱分享给你♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4dabd2da038e02fa01900313271d711cb04fa8085f530a11d66f6645ced6e89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0bf65fdaaee3c67fe87a5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得可爱的机伶\r\n穿上可爱的决胜服后，\r\n就是宇宙第一可爱吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff3fe5f6f1946ffabfceb4a2fe48b66221e181d9e6374ba63e860cc0d9292385",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beee91869f9cd37cbb018710",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「#骏大祭 #酬神舞\r\n#声援 #多多指教」……\r\n好了！呵呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb500bb14f76243f7717bd402a95db5cb64a2097bc6a827a3123d1e129f9922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57268441373462cfea75384c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，谢谢大家转发♪\r\n……等着吧，全新的机伶\r\n会让大家有满～满的感动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f38f37d73fe02c51466424c0fc173c142052cbaeb55fec95ee76bb09abc5abeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d214b55fd96de5aa833c5d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么样的谜团，\r\n都能放心交给名侦探机伶♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "207d10432d425c95142b4b1f48e41369d11199035d66e0338d20abab833bc79b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c39374e1312101360a0bf181",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了，按赞数超过十万了♪\r\n大家要帮忙分享宇宙第一可爱的\r\n机伶穿决胜服的样子喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "143a74e5f832e45818f36fa1ddd3c4f1f5dfd9c600231863b6bcab8fd6961c33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e74f7f6d65f53be45d6616b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家～！我最喜欢你们咯♪\r\n来，你也迷上机伶吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a984a1f28bdc332ada0228c1d9cad957e53621abe2ee952b2ad6c43de72cfac6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b5e474ea49b0cb0868dd49b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动辛苦了。\r\n呵呵，下次该让你见识\r\n哪一种可爱的机伶呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c880b4235517cf05132c05a532558c031e38fda3dcfbef7e7d7d3c9716ce1398",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:181123113ebc12c7d160c28b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发誓和机伶……命运与共♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d49975e7741b9ebb545cee65a67738abe8f214efbf39165685d2d399a503e0e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:816b4f6a381eef53d5e0eba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就这样继续看着我吧。\r\n发誓和机伶……命运与共♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b9701c25eb69a2dfd8b072768e08c0454118ee0bf583691d7ef460b5fa6a222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cc4fbee79e85ad512ae9d6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让机伶的歌声迷倒大家吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcd24061ad68430fff8b631b9de7271226b1219b6e0578d8219f01e55dee3bc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1720f2c1638780ba64b37c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦啦啦噜～♪嗯，真可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "936051721f5d27b7d264ae00ced74e2aff42a55f094484b98e7b6c996ca6f782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95901f65eb7b303058722c1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶在这里哦～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "affbbd172e70a107140f6395e687dd09a47307933bf9bb1e6d8171ca47aeb0a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0225e0e37fdc24ea0528b2e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第一天见面我就决定了。\r\n机伶……\r\n就是要跟着你♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d09b798ab375bdc98ad78b3d3687391b976686de07e508f607a03c809447dc55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f2418b8c397f61f58721c5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到这套制服时，\r\n机伶就觉得注定要穿上它了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b841352f95bd0986f49d9a03eac9a7b436b74d35a1d15f7f72c04f27349621df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ace7e886ab21575bbd5787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘的荷叶边～♪\r\n在舞台上很抢眼对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf492c41db956682f2b58417261610e8e191c4a4d782da63e7d264f71bd6d50b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31cf5d573c23d72a2a1326c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是赛马娘最棒的打扮。\r\n现在的机伶很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b492dc41006a47fc538da94a60583917afb7a5205c91c578ec8fdb2cc7430e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c29f8d276fcae20886839fe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有现在才能享受制服的青春感觉，\r\n我好想拼命穿它哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb0d134308546a257518a10aaf6e037b3a49ba407307ccb3c160d8605579ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:467c20e0e325b230ec47314f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶穿着吊袜带……\r\n会让你小鹿乱撞吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d840efa8798ec603a5db6d4578baf9815d22139c486d108126df0c613d0f581",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67cf1472614af620f15b04e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装塞满了机伶的终极武器。\r\n……我一定要登上巅峰才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "21342f4233c9664aa204c9770f4bb6e7fb976ddb5a466beb1a8c8c6869070a78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0d0561a9772bb6da313ca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪你能从这件决胜服，\r\n感受到我们的命运吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "624713205fa129444f874817066a13864a2e0f327a6764d2961a8ce93e4e3939",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70c998a60c75cd9023fad67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件黑色衣服～\r\n是机伶「认真」的可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "90b00ba46557f96fbd249a3671cd6eef7839d9d3598c7fb3bf3ade63024e14b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e82e8a7640118fc91d684f3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55ff3d4663880cfc859ca0b220d271a88c52fb350ed26371b2af31f71e6444e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff161125eb4554b205d24530",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶才是最可爱的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d024db203c80d0ce73ac48703d96bc4597e3f176a36cb1240db855d6c8a0186",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea0b72889b2017e06bb2bbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想邀我去约会了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79df8705999e46aa803017a5928b1749d3baea67a1e257232763ebc41a22fb9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfce3d3e7c8a3c54c88fc13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可以将真机伶的可爱穿搭\r\n头到脚仔细看过一遍唷♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adfeea57ddfadeccc0245a849d440eef987058a617edb3fcfa77b6705d43e1a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:614f0f513c7913ab68ccb97b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到这套制服时，\r\n机伶就觉得注定要穿上它了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b841352f95bd0986f49d9a03eac9a7b436b74d35a1d15f7f72c04f27349621df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217d0944ce7577d9712f8ac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘的荷叶边～♪\r\n在舞台上很抢眼对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf492c41db956682f2b58417261610e8e191c4a4d782da63e7d264f71bd6d50b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8473d7485bfaa21e552228d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是赛马娘最棒的打扮。\r\n现在的机伶很可爱吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b492dc41006a47fc538da94a60583917afb7a5205c91c578ec8fdb2cc7430e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:851aa391ba491ca41ea8e8c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只有现在才能享受制服的青春感觉，\r\n我好想拼命穿它哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb0d134308546a257518a10aaf6e037b3a49ba407307ccb3c160d8605579ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
