      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:194686a78cbb909232b234a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f4bce504ad3a782bc7db58c1c3bf690d86ff33e4ad95b0ec3aed85c79ec42e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2710b12b576e8d2eeb320e87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真机伶才是最可爱的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6813e894e2d666b65e30934a20390ef5214b66ea7ddeda4b6975dbd086f77679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "800000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e72f03a9d985123b2f7d3914",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想跟机伶玩吗？\r\n我们来尽情享受一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0c5819c3e3a51bec9e690a3052a14f6138698db482f4dd79031e1963a0e0e20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7c90a9dc343a2669f4f3eb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都好厉害哦♪\r\n那机伶就来变得\r\n更厉害好了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "61113409d0420be265707e4bf24670d0a76b01a45957cbaafc4852b5a9a89113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24452fdd5f39e949e27b5073",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，早安！\r\n今天的机伶也是\r\n可爱得无懈可击吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1f6ba3dc18d1ccb00fb6b90869d3cbcdbb218213ce1985b868e476beaf66a49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88caa4dcb37385bef80e984d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上的例行计划？\r\n应该是一起床就向太阳公公打招呼吧！\r\n请它今天也要让我耀眼动人☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b1b67b480f9910ad961fa6823efd0abfa79147778c5d679a3bb3ab1f753f225",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e618e3cd39afe7c2022c479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『#今天的点心　#好烦恼\r\n#马卡龙　#蛋糕　#芭菲\r\n#消除可爱不足』……写好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b9e38118384a89151adc9f49b3307d568e26efcfc55cb15e183660dc10898d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08285156f1955cacf6474ae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……有点想睡……\r\n哥哥，你要当我的抱枕吗？\r\n没有啦☆……下次再说吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29ee1a16288efb38bda51ba1bdf656d122107eb5ebcdbc77c667b9ea5cc7526",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d66ad56e9b1ea4c2e609ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶闪闪动人的笑容，\r\n当作你努力一整天的奖励♪\r\n来，只给你一个人独占哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8426373049c6fbca94794a3acae8da314589b0cf3558b22a55938f6c82e37c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe51b675d0837982afa16352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别熬夜了，快睡吧？\r\n这样的话，或许在梦中\r\n也能见到机伶……哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "47c25aff4086c4e35f2a13f0d503e63880b88e9155228794ffd823f6a4cb685f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3986e1a95a5652a3272313d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我哥哥以前很喜欢与春天有关的\r\n曲子，所以机伶的拿手曲目\r\n也多半和春天相关！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12fab86c463160a48ab1429e42bf85abc12acecfaa823b9e6475ad515684e75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603bf223266753bcd9ea12c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶不管是在家里或学校，都很少\r\n觉得热呢。是因为回过神来\r\n就有人帮忙扇风的关系……吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff049de81cf9b2793781ca3ca859e996ab1c0b86cf8d1e71cbaeadf971bbc36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c37e791aa345a6351f0ec79f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不是只有叶子会染上颜色哦。\r\n比方说，耳朵靠过来……呼～♪\r\n啊哈哈，你看，变得红通通的了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11c7aff2cb6444063de7f658c7a1e27cec314ef2b03f6a9edfa1b6a55b94560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f39f4914fd7c6a4a701ee4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎……机伶快要结冰了。\r\n呐，帮我取暖吧？该怎么做？当然是\r\n用热～呼呼的……关东煮约会之类咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce75c242c2f48086c07112c017438cebc8fe863dfb7ffcfc24e18eb928c0a7a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d36fd0a72a16a30055110b87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥早餐比较喜欢吃饭？吃面包？\r\n还是……喜欢机伶呢？开玩笑的♪\r\n机伶喜欢的是……秘密喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a73d22553b14008f9c8d772fca149249b89c7b5f12d18033d72e0d9bba1e5528",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a5b008fbc6c6c87857f07e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥去上班时，\r\n想要别人怎么送你出门？\r\n机伶可以让你指定喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "61116a33f68f832ede20b484d71217b57f06525c369cb63987064b54c3549fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a8794f8a60d1e9082608689",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机伶下次想和\r\n哥哥一起吃午餐呢～\r\n让机伶喂你吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a389d6cb1276089af49330e9a4001403c4d1a5050d585120b937ce46651d0984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1038",
        "90012"
      ]
    }
  ]
